  "description": "OYINAO crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H94 Dy3 N4 Ni4 O28 1-,C1 H2 Cl2,9(H2 O1),Na1 1+. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.402-3.862 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.31-109.36°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C103H113Cl2N4NaDy3Ni4O37.",
